## Title: Bagnon (harness stand-in)
## Notes: Not Bagnon. A small stand-in for tools/harness/flow_bagnon.py: window classes with a title format, its windows registry, three bag rules and four key binding names, shaped like Bagnon's. It holds none of its English: the flow runs Bagnon's own locale file from the installed addon first.
